# 
# The text description file for Spotweld elog messages
# The English version
# A message is described according to:
# - line 1  	a header for the message log, Maximum 25 characters
# - line 2-x	The reason for message. Maximum 200 char on 5 lines
# - line x+1	\t\n to separate reason from check list
# - line x+2-y	The check list for message. Maximum 200 char on 5 lines
#
# $Revision: 1.1 $
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# File = sw_elog.eng
# Text resource number = TX_RES_SW_ELOG
73::
#
# PURPOSE: Defines the name for the Category Spotweld.
#	The name is used in the error dialog title 2
# LIMITS: no_of_char = 20  no_of_lines = 1
# USED: WINDOW_TITLE
#
0:
Spotweld
#
# PURPOSE: ...
# LIMITS: no_of_char = ..  no_of_lines = .
# USED: ...
#

