#SYS_ERR_SWD_STATE
1:
Spot weld system error\n
Spot weld proc not idle\n
\t\n
Set the process state defined by SwInit\n
to idle
#
#SYS_ERR_SWD_INPAR
2:
Spot weld system error\n
Parameter %s\n
\t\n

#
3:
SwStart Timeout negative\n
\t\n

#
4:
SwInit Interrupt negative\n
\t\n

#
5:
ProcId. The reason is either:\n
-ProcId does not correspond to the\n
 value given from SwInit\n
-The spot weld process has been\n
 cancelled\n
\t\n

